\( u_{n+1} = \frac{1}{2}\left(u_{n}+\frac{10000}{ u_{n}}\right)\).

</div>
<p>
\name_calcul[1] \(u_\n1\), \(u_\n2\) \name_calcul[2] \(u_\n3\) \name_calcul[3]
</p>

<div class="wims_instruction">\name_instruction</div>

